# Public hoist — any package listed in the root `dependencies` or
# `devDependencies` is auto-resolvable from every workspace package
# without re-declaring in each sub-package's package.json. The root
# package.json is the single source of truth for shared versions.
#
# Pattern: add a package to root + bump here when updating; sub-packages
# pick up the new version automatically. Without this, pnpm's default
# `nodeLinker: isolated` would force each sub-package to redeclare the
# dep (or fail to resolve), which is exactly the version-drift problem
# we're avoiding.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*
